{"sectionId":"endocrine/thyroid-adrenal","items":[{"id":"endocrine--thyroid-adrenal-k001","sectionId":"endocrine/thyroid-adrenal","unitId":"endocrine","subject":"biology","text":"갑상샘 여포세포는 Na⁺/I⁻ symporter로 iodide를 흡수하고 thyroperoxidase가 thyroglobulin의 tyrosine iodination 및 coupling을 촉진한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"endocrine--thyroid-adrenal-k002","sectionId":"endocrine/thyroid-adrenal","unitId":"endocrine","subject":"biology","text":"T4와 T3가 분비되고 말초 deiodinase가 T4를 활성 T3 등으로 전환한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"endocrine--thyroid-adrenal-k003","sectionId":"endocrine/thyroid-adrenal","unitId":"endocrine","subject":"biology","text":"T3는 핵수용체를 통해 기초대사와 발달에 영향을 준다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"endocrine--thyroid-adrenal-k004","sectionId":"endocrine/thyroid-adrenal","unitId":"endocrine","subject":"biology","text":"TRH–TSH–T3/T4 축은 음성 피드백으로 조절된다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"endocrine--thyroid-adrenal-k005","sectionId":"endocrine/thyroid-adrenal","unitId":"endocrine","subject":"biology","text":"갑상샘 C세포는 calcitonin을 분비한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"endocrine--thyroid-adrenal-k006","sectionId":"endocrine/thyroid-adrenal","unitId":"endocrine","subject":"biology","text":"부신피질 사구대는 aldosterone, 속상대는 cortisol, 망상대는 androgen을 주로 합성한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"endocrine--thyroid-adrenal-k007","sectionId":"endocrine/thyroid-adrenal","unitId":"endocrine","subject":"biology","text":"aldosterone은 angiotensin II와 K⁺ 증가에 의해 조절되며 신장 distal nephron에서 Na⁺ 재흡수와 K⁺ 분비를 촉진한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"endocrine--thyroid-adrenal-k008","sectionId":"endocrine/thyroid-adrenal","unitId":"endocrine","subject":"biology","text":"cortisol은 ACTH 조절을 받으며 당신생·혈관 반응과 스트레스 적응 및 항염증에 관여한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"endocrine--thyroid-adrenal-k009","sectionId":"endocrine/thyroid-adrenal","unitId":"endocrine","subject":"biology","text":"부신수질 chromaffin 세포는 epinephrine과 norepinephrine을 분비한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"endocrine--thyroid-adrenal-k010","sectionId":"endocrine/thyroid-adrenal","unitId":"endocrine","subject":"biology","text":"catecholamine은 급성 교감 반응에, cortisol은 상대적으로 느린 유전자 조절에도 관여한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"endocrine--thyroid-adrenal-k011","sectionId":"endocrine/thyroid-adrenal","unitId":"endocrine","subject":"biology","text":"사구대–알도스테론, 속상대–코르티솔, 망상대–androgen.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"endocrine--thyroid-adrenal-k012","sectionId":"endocrine/thyroid-adrenal","unitId":"endocrine","subject":"biology","text":"TPO는 갑상샘 호르몬 합성에 필수적이다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"endocrine--thyroid-adrenal-k013","sectionId":"endocrine/thyroid-adrenal","unitId":"endocrine","subject":"biology","text":"TSH와 T3/T4의 음성 피드백을 이해한다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"endocrine--thyroid-adrenal-k014","sectionId":"endocrine/thyroid-adrenal","unitId":"endocrine","subject":"biology","text":"일차성 내분비 장애와 중추성 장애는 상위 호르몬 반응이 다를 수 있다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"endocrine--thyroid-adrenal-k015","sectionId":"endocrine/thyroid-adrenal","unitId":"endocrine","subject":"biology","text":"TSH 증가, free T4 감소이다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]}]}